",null,{\"className\":\"border-b border-gray-100 pb-6 mb-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"How to Use DeepSeek AI for Data Extraction and Analysis: The 2026 Master Guide\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center text-sm text-gray-500 gap-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-900\",\"children\":\"Last Updated:\"}],[\"$\",\"time\",null,{\"dateTime\":\"2026-02-02T10:11:46Z\",\"children\":\"2 February 2026\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 relative w-full h-auto aspect-video rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-gray-100\",\"children\":\"$L2e\"}]]}],\"$L2f\"]}],\"$L30\"]}]]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"link\",\"43\",{\"rel\":\"mask-icon\",\"href\":\"/icon-v2.svg\",\"color\":\"#4b0082\"}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"$L31\",\"44\",{}]\n32:I[1398,[\"/_next/static/chunks/7871b60fc891ab96.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/c1f3fffdf1d840b7.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/19701a61bc0542e6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/c4f2d57ce4578b7e.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/39fff9f81ea21df5.js\"],\"default\"]\n2e:[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{\"src\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/ff1f69b1538fdb7683f798db7191e8ab1bb39ded-1200x675.webp\",\"alt\":\"Visualization of DeepSeek-V3.2 neural network processing unstructured data for automated analysis in 2026\",\"fill\":true,\"className\":\"object-cover\",\"priority\":true}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-10 border-l-4 border-[#4b0082] pl-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L32\",null,{\"value\":\"Updated Dec 2025: A complete guide to using DeepSeek-V3.2 for efficient data extraction. Discover how its \\\"Thinking in Tool-Use\\\" architecture and Context Caching outperform GPT-5.1 for UAE enterprises.\"}]}],false,[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"prose prose-lg prose-slate max-w-none  prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-slate-900  prose-a:text-[#4b0082] prose-a:font-bold hover:prose-a:text-amber-500  prose-img:rounded-2xl prose-img:shadow-md\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L32\",null,{\"value\":[{\"_key\":\"fa4b2173076c\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"103cf4105d2c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Editor’s Note (December 5, 2025):\"},{\"_key\":\"ea7e5f269cce\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"As we approach 2026, the AI landscape has shifted dramatically with the official release of \"},{\"_key\":\"ee7a5bbe2a3d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\",\"strong\"],\"text\":\"DeepSeek-V3.2\"},{\"_key\":\"6b1de9d942a9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\". This guide has been completely overhauled to reflect its groundbreaking capabilities—from its \\\"Thinking in Tool-Use\\\" architecture and cost-saving Context Caching to its superior Arabic language support—making it the definitive choice for enterprises in the Middle East.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"blockquote\"},{\"_key\":\"360bf13f7716\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"2b30c4e8ed1a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"In today’s data-driven world, businesses are drowning in documents but starving for insights. Traditional OCR tools are now obsolete, struggling with multilingual invoices, complex layouts, and the sheer volume of PDFs. Enter \"},{\"_key\":\"5b2498b8ca4e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"DeepSeek AI\"},{\"_key\":\"45177d1c4441\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", which has emerged as the 2026 standard for cost-effective, high-precision data extraction.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"d0e0ac043043\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a87cefce795f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"DeepSeek-V3.2: An Architectural Leap\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"e677c0c3201d\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"1bb5346cf9c0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"DeepSeek-V3.2 isn't just an incremental update. Unlike its predecessors, the V3.2 model utilizes a refined \"},{\"_key\":\"606a985964a9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"\\\"Sparse Mixture of Experts\\\" (MoE)\"},{\"_key\":\"a875adff0b12\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" architecture. This allows it to activate only the necessary neurons for specific tasks, making it \"},{\"_key\":\"69979599d045\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"40% faster and significantly cheaper\"},{\"_key\":\"f264c6b7da4c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" than heavyweights like GPT-5.1 or Gemini 3 Pro.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"54068c188c4f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a533e44389e6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Key 2026 Features That Redefine Data Processing:\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"04b8e60e7048\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"4318809ea07b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"200k Context Window:\"},{\"_key\":\"12c08f4c50b5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Analyze massive 500-page PDF reports in a single pass without losing coherence.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"ab1370f392ce\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"7d0af570d5fd\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Native JSON Mode:\"},{\"_key\":\"ee48ea706a77\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Guarantees output in clean, parseable JSON/XML formats ready for Excel or SQL databases—eliminating the \\\"chatty\\\" conversational fluff found in other models.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"f2c0ea73154f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"f9236ffa9e89\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"\\\"Thinking in Tool-Use\\\":\"},{\"_key\":\"010ccf200d88\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" This breakthrough allows the model to maintain a reasoning trace across multiple tool calls, enabling fluid multi-step problem solving.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"034e0adde5f7\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"f44df5241ccd\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Local Deployment:\"},{\"_key\":\"305836c16fe1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Critical for UAE government and finance sectors, V3.2's open-weights model can be run on local servers, ensuring total data sovereignty.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"c11d23e887fa\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"05e08dc8f476\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\\nBenchmark Performance: Holding Its Own Against Giants\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"b7f2bffd02e9\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d5c2e771b574\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Independent benchmarks confirm DeepSeek's place among the leaders. The \"},{\"_key\":\"7a88ed0abc5e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"V3.2-Speciale\"},{\"_key\":\"3ee7068397dc\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" variant achieved a \"},{\"_key\":\"31e7dc253ae2\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"96.0% pass rate\"},{\"_key\":\"36251be30a37\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" on the AIME 2025 math competition, outperforming GPT-5-High (94.6%) and rivaling Gemini-3.0-Pro (95.0%).\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"3438844a4d89\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"e5bb81695810\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"For coding tasks, it resolved \"},{\"_key\":\"332816812455\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"73.1%\"},{\"_key\":\"ab17faa1bee3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" of real-world software bugs, staying competitive with GPT-5-High at 74.9%. This performance comes at a fraction of the cost, thanks to its DeepSeek Sparse Attention (DSA) architecture.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"7f76fd65a7f5\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"4421fb38f6f6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"8459062e44ca\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"87df3d556065\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"How to Use DeepSeek for Extraction: A Step-by-Step Guide\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"37ab8c0044cc\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"86fc7a2360a7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Turning documents into data is a systematic process. Here’s how to do it with DeepSeek-V3.2:\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"b2fd2953bfdc\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"222675f1cc3a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Step 1: Define Your Schema & Activate JSON Mode\"},{\"_key\":\"9afd40097304\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Instead of asking generic questions, tell DeepSeek exactly what structure you want. Use the response_format parameter to enforce JSON output.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"e6db593a61e1\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"241d04b2e54d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Example Python Code:\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"70f86a90a63a\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"3a4924ed49c4\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Python\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"bbe1365728b8\",\"_type\":\"code\",\"code\":\"import json\\nfrom openai import OpenAI\"},{\"_key\":\"393a76ae6dad\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"9c359bc09604\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"DeepSeek uses the OpenAI SDK structure\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"e96e9c0b15f8\",\"_type\":\"code\",\"code\":\"client = OpenAI(api_key=\\\"YOUR_KEY\\\", base_url=\\\"https://api.deepseek.com\\\")\\n\\nsystem_prompt = \\\"\\\"\\\"\\nExtract the Invoice Number, Date, and Total Amount from the provided text.\\nReturn ONLY a JSON object with those keys.\\nExample output: {\\\"invoice_number\\\": \\\"INV-2025-001\\\", \\\"date\\\": \\\"2025-12-05\\\", \\\"total\\\": 1500.00}\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nresponse = client.chat.completions.create(\\n    model=\\\"deepseek-chat\\\",\\n    messages=[{\\\"role\\\": \\\"system\\\", \\\"content\\\": system_prompt},\\n              {\\\"role\\\": \\\"user\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Your document text here...\\\"}],\\n    response_format={'type': 'json_object'}  # Enables JSON mode\\n)\\n\\nprint(json.loads(response.choices[0].message.content))\\n\"},{\"_key\":\"aa73eef4d82e\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"62888e6562d7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"Source: DeepSeek API Docs on JSON Output\"},{\"_key\":\"92dc15a64108\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\\n\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"bf81971276ea\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"da1a942503f5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Step 2: Leverage Context Caching for Massive Cost Savings\"},{\"_key\":\"f611a3f62fb6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" DeepSeek's \"},{\"_key\":\"29b9e064f58c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Context Caching on Disk\"},{\"_key\":\"b007f5368ef6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" technology is a game-changer for bulk processing. If you ask multiple questions about the same 100-page document, you only pay to upload the document once.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"c360c8cdbaf2\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"5c7c7e335c04\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Step 3: From Extraction to Analysis\"},{\"_key\":\"8ed67d626b11\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Once data is extracted, DeepSeek shines at analysis. It can spot anomalies (e.g., \\\"This invoice is 20% higher than the monthly average\\\") and perform trend analysis across thousands of data points instantly.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"ac8c4d70e395\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"64e752b9beba\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"002b6525cee0\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"4321abf9ba24\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The UAE Advantage: Local Hosting & Arabic Support\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"a1cbb09fde11\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"82d547d24410\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"For industries like Fintech and Healthcare in the UAE, data privacy is paramount. DeepSeek's \"},{\"_key\":\"4e58ae8cd26e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"open-weights model\"},{\"_key\":\"9dc075a737e0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" allows organizations to run the AI entirely offline or on local cloud infrastructure (like Khazna or Etisalat Cloud).\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"237ea9870bb8\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"bcfb429089a0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Furthermore, DeepSeek's training on multilingual datasets covering over 100 languages, including \"},{\"_key\":\"7d79e9b28459\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Arabic script\"},{\"_key\":\"eb4ed81b3566\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", makes it uniquely capable of parsing mixed English/Arabic invoices and legal documents without the formatting errors common in US-centric models.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\